"""Street Legends frontend: Dominoes Table house item - Dominoes PvC,
PLAYER VS PLAYER rooms + PvP game, MOVE / SELL ($10,000 back).
Run from repo root: python3 frontend/patch-house-dominoes-frontend.py
Idempotent - safe to re-run.
Same proven pattern as pool + darts + cards, with one fix baked in: the menu
render line is written WITH onPlayPvp in the first place, so no later wiring
patch (and no global "already wired" check) is needed.
FRONTEND ONLY - reload Expo Go to check. Rooms work once the backend domino
rooms endpoints are live; if the backend is not live yet, the rooms screen
says so instead of crashing.
"""
